{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of Eleanor Hartfield, a grieving widow suffering from dissociative amnesia, and unravel buried memories to uncover the chilling truth behind your husband\u2019s mysterious death. Wander the halls of an eerie 1920s mansion as haunting visions torment you and the line between reality and nightmare begins to blur.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an atmospheric 1920s mansion filled with secrets, shadows, and lingering dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the tragic story of Eleanor Hartfield and the mysterious death of her husband through environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve cryptic puzzles and unlock hidden passages to reveal the mansion\u2019s darkest truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a slow psychological unraveling where reality and nightmare begin to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121560/extras/a8e9b5f75ccf583728c0c9a40ee7df6a.poster.avif?t=1762006814\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121560/extras/a8e9b5f75ccf583728c0c9a40ee7df6a.webm?t=1762006814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121560/extras/a8e9b5f75ccf583728c0c9a40ee7df6a.mp4?t=1762006814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121560?t=1762006814","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121560?t=1762006814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121560/5db92fb00fa